1. Google Gemini (image generation)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Some or all of the in-game art assets (character sprites, monster
sprites, boss sprites, environment tiles, decor, particles) were
generated using Google's Gemini family of image models, accessed via
the Gemini API under a personal developer account.

  - Service: Google AI Studio / Gemini API
  - Models used (typical): gemini-2.5-flash-image, gemini-2.0-flash
  - URL: https://aistudio.google.com/
  - Terms of Service: https://ai.google.dev/terms
  - Generative AI Prohibited Use Policy:
    https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/

Compliance:

  (a) All generated content was produced under personal creative
      direction of the project owner using original prompts authored
      for this project (see assets/ai-gen/prompts/ and PROMPTS_*.md).
  (b) No realistic likenesses of identifiable real persons were
      generated or used.
  (c) Generated content was reviewed by the project owner for
      compliance with Google's Prohibited Use Policy before
      integration into the game.
  (d) The project owner retains responsibility for all generated
      content per Google's terms.
  (e) The project does not redistribute Gemini model weights, only
      output pixels.

We thank the Google Gemini team for providing this capability, which
made it possible to produce a diverse, themed art set as a solo
developer without commercial art-pipeline budgets.

